! Media Importer

This plugin allows you to search and import metadata for various media types into your TiddlyWiki.

!! Supported Sources
* ''Books'': OpenLibrary
* ''Comics'': ComicVine (Requires API Key)
* ''Games'': RAWG (Requires API Key)
* ''Manga'': AniList
* ''Movies'': TMDB (Requires API Key)
* ''TV Shows'': TMDB (Requires API Key)

!! Setup

After installing, please go to the ''Control Panel'' > ''Settings'' > ''Media Importer'' to configure your API keys.

!! Usage

Create a new tiddler for media imports and paste the text: `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/ui}}`.

To create the library browser, create a tiddler with this text: `{{$:/plugins/mblackman/media-importer/library}}`.